    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Could anyone add a bit more detail to this? I really don't understand it, yet it seems like it's used quite often in Japanese. All the English translations I've found make no sense to me, and \"about\" isn't very descriptive. Thanks.",
      "html": "Could anyone add a bit more detail to this? I really don't understand it, yet it seems like it's used quite often in Japanese. All the English translations I've found make no sense to me, and \"about\" isn't very descriptive. Thanks.",
      "credits_raw": "quobobo",
