    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "is it dono Gurai or dono Kurai ? is there any rule for this or just depends on the speaker?",
      "html": "is it dono Gurai or dono Kurai ? is there any rule for this or just depends on the speaker?",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "a06a4221263715656cdf9bc830a2b4a0fc2b5a3d61a4f6b7cef5b160a55551e9",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Reply to dc's 質問. I don't think there is any rule for Gurai and Kurai. Even I sometimes think which of them is more often used for a prior word. We often use both like 10分くらい、10分ぐらい、あいさつくらい、あいさつぐらい、どれくらい、どれぐらい。You can see them by Google search.",
      "html": "Reply to dc's 質問. I don't think there is any rule for Gurai and Kurai. Even I sometimes think which of them is more often used for a prior word. We often use both like 10分くらい、10分ぐらい、あいさつくらい、あいさつぐらい、どれくらい、どれぐらい。You can see them by Google search.",
      "credits_raw": "Miki",
      "content_sha256": "330c8f7217a1742de39a69e241f20183c7ba9b3989061ee8071072957142bbba",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "KURAI here implies 程度. the rough standard, the degree, or the range of something. So, ex#609 implies somebody is expected at least a manner something like a hello. ex#3117, somebody is expected to do at least something like what a child can do.",
      "html": "KURAI here implies 程度. the rough standard, the degree, or the range of something. So, ex#609 implies somebody is expected at least a manner something like a hello. ex#3117, somebody is expected to do at least something like what a child can do.",
      "credits_raw": "your name",
      "content_sha256": "d0f67d62d24cf6d1e0e73315326e545fd88066a76bbbb2538be8afa36d0bdee3",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 6,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "婚約したことを友人くらい伝えたらどうですか。 \nWhy don't you tell your engagement to at least your friends/ to at least somebody like your friends?\n私にはこれくらいしかできない。 Least I could do. (ex from ALC)\nアルコール中心の昼食の後で請求書をサッと取れるくらいしらふである \nbe sober enough to grab the bill at the end of a liquid lunch. (ex from ALC)\n私が払えるのはそれくらいです。 That's about all I can pay. (ex from ALC)",
      "html": "婚約したことを友人くらい伝えたらどうですか。 <br/>Why don't you tell your engagement to at least your friends/ to at least somebody like your friends?<br/>私にはこれくらいしかできない。 Least I could do. (ex from ALC)<br/>アルコール中心の昼食の後で請求書をサッと取れるくらいしらふである <br/>be sober enough to grab the bill at the end of a liquid lunch. (ex from ALC)<br/>私が払えるのはそれくらいです。 That's about all I can pay. (ex from ALC)",
      "credits_raw": "your name",
      "content_sha256": "0b7a344ae3ca009c4e7c1b8bc1535c32de7a5a4f38c0baa6deeedfff99a83a91",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 7,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "See also gurai ぐらい",
      "html": "See also gurai ぐらい",
      "credits_raw": "Amatuka",
