    {
      "position": 9,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "くらい is used when it comes in as a single word and ぐらい is mainly used in combinations.",
      "html": "くらい is used when it comes in as a single word and ぐらい is mainly used in combinations.",
      "credits_raw": "rochin",
      "content_sha256": "bff87aa1d3716fb121a7d43810b2bbd7c3f869f11f5c639b73675824fe24c5c5",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 10,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "What about the as.. as meaning of くらい? I'd add it myself, but I'm not very familiar with it yet. I know なら is with it a lot, though, or some sort of conditional. For example (from the wwwjdic)...\nあんな男と結婚するくらいなら死んだ方がましだ。 \nI might as well die as marry such a man. \nそれをするくらいなら死んだほうがましだ。\nI may as well die as do it.",
      "html": "What about the as.. as meaning of くらい? I'd add it myself, but I'm not very familiar with it yet. I know なら is with it a lot, though, or some sort of conditional. For example (from the wwwjdic)...<br/>あんな男と結婚するくらいなら死んだ方がましだ。 <br/>I might as well die as marry such a man. <br/>それをするくらいなら死んだほうがましだ。<br/>I may as well die as do it.",
      "credits_raw": "Megan",
      "content_sha256": "05b5558aef287b54c72791677f9e4bf6c2bdb8f22d99907aa3c1d66f6847585b",
      "original_created_at": null,
