    {
      "position": 12,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I have been taught to use it this way:\n\"ｘはｙくらいです\", meaning \"Y is about the only X\". This can only be used when Y is about the only case where X holds true. X and Y are both either nouns or noun phrases.\nE.g. 東京が静かになるのは，お盆のころくらいです。",
      "html": "I have been taught to use it this way:<br/>\"ｘはｙくらいです\", meaning \"Y is about the only X\". This can only be used when Y is about the only case where X holds true. X and Y are both either nouns or noun phrases.<br/>E.g. 東京が静かになるのは，お盆のころくらいです。",
      "credits_raw": "mel",
      "content_sha256": "536092453f1ef7bddd720e39965d49a47ef1f2aed51d5337b0d7914c5bd751e8",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
